{"id": 992394, "slug": "an-aisling", "name": "An Aisling", "name_original": "An Aisling", "description": "<p>Siobhan awakens from a dream at the highest point of the island Rashinmore. Rashinmore was once a quiet and warm community, games were played and friends were made. Nothing bad would ever happen here, but things change. In the last week a disappearance has left people lost and devastated. Everyone wants answers, but the ones in charge don't seem to have a clue. If they're not going to lift a finger to find out whats going on, who will...? </p><p>Things feel different when the sun goes down... is there something hiding in the dark?</p><p>An Aisling is an adventure game focused on exploration, story, and character. Make friends or enemies as you try to uncover why people are dissappearing on the island of Rashinmore.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><p> Run, jump, talk or even punch your way through the island as you uncover the mystery on Rashinmore. </p></li><li><p> Choose to make friends or enemies with a colourful cast of characters and creatures. </p></li><li><p> Paint pictures, catch creatures, conduct choirs, run races and see stars.</p></li><li><p> Original art and soundtrack.</p></li><li><p> Not one but two dogs! There's maybe even a secret third... </p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-11-08", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-11-11T08:01:29", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/833/833b13efba8553ab8e2c0f998871225b.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/141/141b6a2541d716563a2690b322467d2b.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 9, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "tw